[00:14.10]Beware the eye of the dragon
[00:14.10]当心龙之眼
[00:15.69]Stay safe and out of sight
[00:15.69]远离保平安
[00:17.59]‘Cause once it gets you in its gaze
[00:17.59]一朝惹睥睨
[00:19.36]This creature comes to life
[00:19.36]画龙自升天
[00:20.71]
[00:21.25]It’ll rise above the masses
[00:21.25]腾龙远人间
[00:22.95]And darken up the sky
[00:22.95]蔽日连遮天
[00:24.77]And nature and her elements
[00:24.77]万物失光彩
[00:26.56]Will take you by surprise
[00:26.56]尔等徒哗然
[00:28.09]（MUSIC）
